      "updated": 1788424178176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "->Talk in English\n->Speak english\n->close the door\n->go to the doctor\n->Think big do big\n->Sonu bring a cup of tea.\n->keep quiet.\n->Attend your class tommorow\n->call him\n->wash your clothes with soap.\n->find your mobile\n->bring the key of the gate\n->Stay with that boy\n->keep the mobile in silent mode\n->Cut bitter gourd with knife\n->Think about your feature\n->wash hands\n->Switch off light\n->Brush your teeth\n->Go back",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "->Talk in English\n->Speak english\n->close the door\n->go to the doctor\n->Think big do big\n->Sonu bring a cup of tea.\n->keep quiet.\n->Attend your class tommorow\n->call him\n->wash your clothes with soap.\n->find your mobile\n->bring the key of the gate\n->Stay with that boy\n->keep the mobile in silent mode\n->Cut bitter gourd with knife\n->Think about your feature\n->wash hands\n->Switch off light\n->Brush your teeth\n->Go back",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
