      "text": "->don't  talk in English \n->don't walk with me\n->don't follow me\n->don't make fun grandpa's room\n->don't go here and there in school\n->don't listen to him\n->don't talk nonsense\n->don't take tea too much\n->don't sleep with a blenket.\n->don't drag off the table\n->don't keep that window open\n->don't shout the kids\n->don't come here\n->don't throw it here",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "->don't  talk in English \n->don't walk with me\n->don't follow me\n->don't make fun grandpa's room\n->don't go here and there in school\n->don't listen to him\n->don't talk nonsense\n->don't take tea too much\n->don't sleep with a blenket.\n->don't drag off the table\n->don't keep that window open\n->don't shout the kids\n->don't come here\n->don't throw it here",
